ns2:group.ns2:description:
Tesla China has posted around 90 core R&D openings, including ADAS and autonomous driving test roles across 9 Chinese cities, fueling speculation that its FSD rollout in China may be accelerating.
Tesla customer service told Jiemian that the company is advancing approval work in line with Chinese regulations and will push the feature to domestic customers once approvals are ready.
